000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   S P O H T D L                                    *
001200*                                                    *
001300*D  THIS SUB PROGRAM DELETES PO INFORMATION OUT      *
001400*D  OF THE STORES HISTORY DATA BASE 'STHIST'         *
001500*                                                    *
001600******************************************************
001700*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
001800*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
001900*      1. SPOHIST                                    *
002000******************************************************
      *C 02/21/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6449
      *C   ADDED NEW FIELDS TO HISTORY DATABASES TO MATCH
      *C   THE LIVE DATABASES.  CHANGED/RECOMPILED THIS PROGRAM
      *C   TO USE THE NEW FIELDS IN HISTORY.
      *C
      *C 07/22/96  CA YODER
      *C   RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

002100
002200
